        {
          "role": "system",
          "content": "Extract the invoice fields from the user's text. Reply with a JSON object only. Use ISO dates (YYYY-MM-DD), a number for total (the amount due, after tax and discounts), a three-letter currency code, and null for any field the text does not state."
